Why is pruning essential for performance?

Dynamic programming optimizes recursive solutions by storing results.

```js
function fib(n, memo = {}) {
  if (n <= 1) return n;
  if (memo[n]) return memo[n];
  memo[n] = fib(n - 1, memo) + fib(n - 2, memo);
  return memo[n];
}
```

