React.useEffect(() => {
  fetch('https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts')
    .then(res => res.json())
    .then(data => setPosts(data));
}, []);
```

This pattern is extremely common in React applications such as blog feeds, product lists, or user directories.

