Deep linking is configured by mapping URLs to screens.

```js
const linking = {
  prefixes: ['myapp://', 'https://myapp.com'],
  config: {
    screens: {
      Home: 'home',
      Details: 'details/:itemId',
      Profile: 'profile'
    }
  }
};

export default function App() {
  return (
    <NavigationContainer linking={linking}>
      {/* navigators */}
    </NavigationContainer>
  );
}
```

This configuration teaches your app how to interpret incoming URLs.

